    {
      "title": "The Rest of the Packages (Smaller but Important)",
      "description": "The following packages each have their own `docs/dev/packages/*.md` and a lightweight tour entry:\n\n- `common-server` — logging, Sentry, Segment, file wrappers\n- `common-frontend` — shared React bits\n- `common-test-utils` + `engine-test-utils` — the heroic integration test harness\n- `pods-core` — Notion, Roam, JSON, Airtable import/export\n- `api-server` — HTTP side of some publishing features\n- `nextjs-template` — the beautiful static site generator for publishing your vault\n- `dendron-viz`, `dendron-design-system`, `generator-dendron`, etc.\n\nSee the individual package tours under this directory for the ones that have deeper coverage. For the others, start with their package.json + README + the doc in `docs/dev/packages/`.",
